OL,3,GNEWSADozens of disposable barbecues
OL,4,Aseized after ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrading standards officers in Hull have
OL,7,Fseized dozens of disposable barbecues
OL,8,Ffrom local retailers after carrying out
OL,9,Fchecks to ensure businesses were
OL,10,Fcomplying with a nationwide ban.
OL,12,FLast week, the government imposed a
OL,13,Ftemporary ban on the sale of single-use
OL,14,Fbarbecues following a prolonged period
OL,15,Fof hot, dry weather and a spate of
OL,16,Fwildfires across the UK.
OL,18,FDuring a day of targeted action,
OL,19,Fofficers visited more than 60 local
OL,20,Fpremises and found five were still
OL,21,Fselling the items.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
