OL,3,GNEWSADozens of disposable barbecues
OL,4,Aseized after ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ted Dolman, whose portfolio
OL,7,Fincludes trading standards, said: "The
OL,8,Fstep to ban disposable barbecues
OL,9,Freflects the seriousness of the risk
OL,10,Fthey pose to our environment, and
OL,11,Fsafety."
